# Igris USER — your local override surface

This file lives at `~/.igris/USER.md`. It's preserved across `igris init --upgrade`
operations byte-for-byte. Use it for personal customization that should NOT live
in any project repo (because the brain is per-user, not per-project).

## Customization sections

### User identity

- name: {{USER_NAME}}
- email: {{USER_EMAIL}}

### Persona override

By default the orchestrator loads `~/.igris/core/SOUL.md`. Override here:

```yaml
# (leave commented to use the default SOUL)
# persona: terse
```

### Project shortcuts

Frequently-used projects can be aliased here. Run `igris install <path>` first
to register them in the brain.

### Notes

This file is YOURS. Igris will never overwrite it. The only operation that
touches USER.md is the very-first `igris init` (which writes the initial
template); subsequent `igris init --upgrade` runs preserve it byte-for-byte.
